[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/Game Jam 2026 Acrobat Background 1.png" fade="0.0"]
join Acrobat left
label acrobat_greeting
Acrobat: "Hello there!"
if {items.dodge} == false:
	- "The goblins are attacking!"
		Acrobat: "What??"
		Acrobat: "Where??"
		He starts peering around as if goblins could pop out from anywhere anytime.
		Doomsayer: "They're not attacking right now."
		Doomsayer: "The goblins will attack the town at sundown.\
		I was wondering if you could help us defend the church?"
		Acrobat: "I'm flattered you'd ask, but...\
		I'm more of a dancer than a fighter."
		He looks you up and down.
		Acrobat: "Maybe..."
		Acrobat: "Would you like to learn some tricks?"
		- "Yes" [lose 1 hour, gain dodge upgrade] | [if {hours} >= 1.0]
			set {items.dodge} = true
			set {hours} -= 1.0
			You spend an hour training with the acrobat. He seems pleased with how quickly you learn. By the end of the lesson, you feel much lighter on your feet.
			You now have the dodge ability.
			jump acrobat_greeting
		- "No"
			Acrobat: "Another time, then."
			jump acrobat_greeting
	- Return to town square
	leave Acrobat
	jump village/square
elif {items.dodge} == true:
	- "Can I perform with you?" [lose 2 hours, gain 8 gold] | [if {recruitment.acrobat_recruited} == false and {hours} >= 2.0]
		set {conversation.performances} += 1.0
		set {gold} += 8.0
		set {hours} -= 2.0
		You perform with the acrobat for 2 hours. You feel sweaty, but gratified.
		The acrobat was generous enough to split the earnings evenly, so now your pocket is 8 gold heavier.
		if {conversation.performances} == 2.0:
			Acrobat: "It's been nice to perform with someone else. It can get lonely on the stage..."
			Acrobat: "I'd hate to lose my new dance partner...\
			Where did you need me to go tonight?"
			Doomsayer: "The church."
			Acrobat: "I'll be there."
			set {recruitment.acrobat_recruited} = true
			set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
		jump acrobat_greeting
	- Return to town square
	leave Acrobat
	jump village/square
elif {recruitment.acrobat_recruited} == true:
	- Return to town square
	leave Acrobat
	jump village/square